    "created_at": "2025-05-01T18:09:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-01T18:09:18Z",
    "body": "Perhaps we can update the spec to either not change the existing value of a cookie in the deletion algorithm or allow a UA to pick any non-empty value during the algorithm since it should not be persisted anyways? \n\nAny preference between those options? ",
