    "created_at": "2025-05-06T17:34:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-06T17:34:33Z",
    "body": "The spec has been updated to instruct browsers to use a *non-empty* string where the value is implementation defined.\n\nThis is actually what Chromium's implementation was actually doing [for some time](https://crrev.com/c/2316622), I just never updated the spec after I landed that patch. Thanks @aamuley for taking care of that!",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
