    "created_at": "2025-05-29T17:14:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-29T17:14:13Z",
    "body": "I think the spec change I made actually creates another issue-- if the size of the name attribute is the maximum 4096B and we have the cookie value to be a non-empty string during the delete algo, setting the cookie would fail the [`store a cookie`](https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-annevk-johannhof-httpbis-cookies-01.html#section-5.4.3-2.1.1) algo so I may have to re-modify the spec for this case",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
